# NAPI generated loader — regenerated by `napi build` on every build/publish and
# embeds the package version in a per-platform guard (52 occurrences). Committing
# it made every release-please version bump fail the "Generated files are current"
# check, since the bot bumps package.json but cannot regenerate this file.
# index.d.ts stays committed: it is the reviewable API surface and carries no
# version. It is still published — `files` in package.json is an allowlist that
# overrides .gitignore, and the publish job always builds first.
crates/spaghetti-napi/index.js

# Coverage harness ground-truth snapshots (machine-local)
scripts/coverage/out/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Live-tail checkpoint state (runtime artifact, never committed)
.spaghetti-live-state.json
.spaghetti-live-state.json.tmp
